. Would you help me? Would you help .. yourself?","source_tag":"_t","target":"天哪，你……你是另一个我吗？!\n\t\t看来我想的没错，这里已经不是我所在的时间线了！\n\t\t帮帮我！我在这地方迷路了，我有个朋友给我留下了一个传送门，不过我打了太多仗，恐怕靠我自己是到不了那里了，你能帮我一下吗？你能……帮自己一下吗？"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"6e076bf1b339d2472a8bf31cc22d9cc3f6e81769ca29c7355955594ffd4ec5d0","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"6fd8621e57a144ddcf6f8aa58a8cd9480ede14470d056be5162789367db8bbec","logical_entry_identity":"e30bffa34bd224d546254a2ab56667f6a4ad02876a3cc99fa9b1164e17e9a518","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"a logical analysis of creation, by philosopher Smythen","source_tag":"entity name","target":"创世传说的逻辑分析，哲学家斯迈森著"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"52b0a22e24fc22acef83337495da33f3fbc7e1fb6626bf65c7cd5ad35fed4f5b","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"6fdb3f1f57da046fb640cf21d910842b175f44cc23171926730517c4a2a6cbd1","logical_entry_identity":"b7fe98024c70187daed443b08772ed13928db751f201c0c11cec1da5c6b19079","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"Fear","source_tag":"talent name","target":"恐惧"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"04de4d2da81c87368917a81a98139fbdbab48d760ccd544627200ed506c4724f","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"6fdb56a917b1c94014b69ae839e3074606e24d351bd7998603a659c2128a049e","logical_entry_identity":"a56aac5b4db37c8fe34d460f5fb96dbbd7f309bb641560fa44a1179aaf3582cf","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"#GOLD##{bold}#Rest before auto-explore#WHITE##{normal}#","source_tag":"_t","target":"#GOLD##{bold}#自动探索前休息#WHITE##{normal}#"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"fd7b2adfaa1788b0951fe8652af1ebaf3c4bdd685a4e7c1358c890d9d99f3708","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"6fdba592f129335b2757488c28f7b6c2f50773c83f316556ec2d22ce7ddef5c8","logical_entry_identity":"7efa289793d27b0b95a4b1a42c71b8875d1b49ac14d7b6ef229d20dc893cac5a","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"#00FF00#Your stats have changed! (Str %s, Dex %s, Mag %s, Wil %s, Cun %s, Con %s)","source_tag":"logPlayer","target":"#